{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29346","headline":"送崔珏往西川 · 李商隐","name":"送崔珏往西川","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"年少因何有旅愁，欲爲东下更西游。\n一条雪浪吼巫峡，千里火云烧益州。\n卜肆至今多寂寞，酒垆从古擅风流。\n浣花牋纸桃花色，好好题诗咏玉钩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29346.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29346","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}